+/*
+ * test_it_enroll_commit.c — TDD tests for the IT enroll commit
+ * record + payload builder declared in proto.h. Cross-references the
+ * Python tests/test_it_enroll_commit.py and the spec in
+ * docs/it-enroll-commit-decode.md.
